 "description": "NO-WRITE batch FULL-retake plan (dedicated read-scoped registry preflight project_todos.quizzes.retake_plan; KEYLESS by design). Validates every row (assignment binding, stale-review guard, grade ceilings, release eligibility) and returns ordered per-row commands plus a deterministic planChecksum. Nothing is written. Apply via opentrain_quiz_retake_apply. FULL retakes (whole-quiz +1 attempt on the SAME version) \u2014 selective per-question coaching is the opentrain_quiz_coaching_* family. Requires project_todos:read.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
